while (i > 0) 
{
   /* missing code */
}
 Which of the following can be used to replace  /* missing code */  so that the code segment works as intended?
(A)
text += temp.substring(0, 1); 
temp = temp.substring(i + 1); 
i = temp.indexOf(" "); 
