wk_hours = 20;
pay_rate = rt;
}
}
Which of the following code segments, found in a class other than  Employee,  could be used to correctly create
an  Employee  object representing an employee who worked for 20 hours at a rate of $18.50 per hour?
I.
Employee e1 = new Employee("Lili", 20, 18.5);
II.
Employee e2 = new Employee("Steve", 18.5);
III.
Employee e3 = new Employee("Carol", 20);
(A)
I only
(B)
I and II only
(C)
I and III only
(D)
I, II, and III

