 */
public double averageWithinRange(double lower, double upper)

questions.answer:
Reference answer / 参考答案（非官方原版）
Only available items within both bounds contribute to the sum and count. The precondition ensures division by zero cannot occur.

public double averageWithinRange(double lower, double upper) {
    double sum = 0.0;
    int count = 0;
    for (ItemInfo item : inventory) {
        if (item.isAvailable() && item.getCost() >= lower && item.getCost() <= upper) {
            sum += item.getCost();
            count++;
        }
    }
    return sum / count;
}

